=== Rewards ===
Players receive various rewards for reaching certain Slayer levels:

*'''Slayer Level''' - Earning levels in each slayer category will award a permanent stat boost.
*'''Global Combat Wisdom Buff''' - Earn extra {{Stat|Combat Wisdom}} based on unique {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} kills. Beating a new {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} on {{SlayerTier|1}}, {{SlayerTier|2}}, and {{SlayerTier|3}} will give {{Stat|combat wisdom|+1}}, while {{SlayerTier|IV}} and {{SlayerTier|5}} bosses will give {{Stat|combat wisdom|+2}}. The current maximum bonus is a permanent {{Stat|combat wisdom|+36}}.
*'''{{Text anchor|Slayer Bonus Rewards}}{{Text anchor|Slayer Veteran Bonus|}}'''
**Earn {{Green|+3}} of any {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}}'s main token drop when slaying its {{Mcat|Slayer Minibosses}}. This bonus is unlocked upon reaching {{Green|LVL 6}} in Zombie, Wolf, and Spider Slayer.
**Slayers are {{Green|4%}} cheaper. This bonus is unlocked upon reaching {{Green|LVL 7}} in Zombie, Spider, and Wolf Slayer.
*'''Level 8 Perks''' - Each slayer path unlocks a special perk unique to that path when the player reaches level 8.
**[[Enderman Slayer]], notably, unlocks a perk at Level 9.
*'''Bartender Mixins''' - A Mixin from the {{NPCSprite|Bartender}} is unlocked upon reaching LVL 8 in a slayer. These Mixins can be brewed with {{Item|God Potion}}s to give them bonus special effects: Mixins can be directly consumed if a [[Cookie Buff]] is active.
*'''SkyBlock Levels''' - Upon gaining a Slayer Level or defeating all tiers of {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} in one category, players unlock {{SBXP}}.
*'''{{Bits}}''' - Depending on the tier, each {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} will give a certain amount of {{Bits}}.

