== Auto-Slayer ==
'''Auto-Slayer''' is a feature unlocked upon reaching {{Green|LVL 6}} in [[Zombie Slayer]], [[Spider Slayer]], and [[Wolf Slayer]]. When enabled, players will automatically start a new Slayer Quest of the same type upon killing a {{Mcat|Slayer Boss}}, automatically deducting coins from the player's bank.

'''Auto-Slayer''' will only start a new quest of the player has sufficient {{c}} in their purse or [[Bank]], with the purse taking priority over the Bank. If neither the player's purse or Bank have sufficient {{c}}, Auto-Slayer will not begin a new quest.

'''Auto-Slayer''' can be toggled in the Slayer menu.

