===Rolling for Loot===
* The order in which Loot Pools are rolled is as follows: {{Aqua|'''Token'''}} → {{Gold|'''Main'''}} → {{Red|'''Extra'''}}. The newly-added '''Separate''' one is also rolled.
* The order in which Modifiers are applied is as follows, if applicable: [[RNG Meter|{{Pink|'''RNG Meter'''}}]] → {{stat|mf}}.
** Modifiers effects are not carried between Loot Pools. Instead, Modifiers are re-applied for each Loot Pool. 
* Restrictions from '''[[Slayer]] level''' and the '''{{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} tier''' apply:
** For '''[[Slayer]] level''': only items that are unlocked are accounted for their <math>\text{Item Weight}</math>. This means the <math>\color{JungleGreen}\text{Percent Drop Rate}</math> of an item can be inflated from a low [[Slayer]] level.
** For '''{{Mcat|Slayer Boss}} tier''': items that only drop from higher-tiered bosses will not drop from lower-tiered bosses, even if the [[RNG Meter#Slayer|{{Pink|RNG Meter}}]] is full. 
***For example, a {{Item|Judgement Core}} cannot drop from an {{Stier|3}} {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}}.

