====Terminology====
* <math>\text{Item Weight}</math> is the original weight, the "base" weight, before modifiers are applied.
* <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_1}</math> is the <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{Item Weight}}</math> after application of the [[RNG Meter|{{Pink|RNG Meter}}]].
* <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_2}</math> is the <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_1}</math> after application of {{stat|mf}}. It is also called the <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{Percent Drop Chance}}</math> or the <math>{\color{JungleGreen}\text{Final Drop Chance}}</math>.

===={{Aqua|Token}} Loot Pool ====
The first item to drop will be a {{Aqua|'''Token'''}}, with a {{Green|100%}} drop rate.

===={{Gold|Main}} Loot Pool ====
Then, the {{Gold|'''Main'''}} Loot Pool:

