    { \color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_1} = \text{Item Weight} \times \left(1 + \min \left(2 \times \frac{\text{Stored }\color{rhodamine}\text{Slayer XP}}{\text{Required } \color{rhodamine} \text{Slayer XP}}, 2\right)\right)
 </math>
|}
:::Otherwise, <math>{ \color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_1} = \text{Item Weight}</math>.

# <li value="2">If an item's <math>{ \color{JungleGreen}\text{New Weight}_1} < \color{JungleGreen}5\%</math>, then it will be modified according to the following formula:</li>
